 "description": "The motors change from the 50:1 to the 30:1 gearmotor (stall torque 0.74 -> 0.45 kgf*cm, no-load speed 650 -> 1100 rpm), but mechanical.gearboxes is left as in the base: gear_ratio 148.3, torque_peak and reaction_moment 110 kgf*cm, no_load_speed 0.459 rad/s. It should read 86.1, 38.7 kgf*cm, 38.7 kgf*cm and 1.34 rad/s. That leaves the gearbox's stated torque nearly three times what the new motors can deliver, and its ratio disagrees with the 86.1:1 the drivetrain and control nodes now use. It has no no_change_justified entry for electrical.motors.",
